{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 4,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hear, ye children, the instruction of a father, and attend to know understanding.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I give you good doctrine, forsake ye not my law.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I was my father's son, tender and only ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "beloved",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the sight of my mother.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He taught me also, and said to me, Let thy heart retain my words: keep my commandments, and live.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Get wisdom, get understanding: forget ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not; neither decline from the words of my mouth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Forsake her not, and she shall preserve thee: love her, and she shall keep thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wisdom ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the principal thing; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "therefore",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " get wisdom: and with all thy getting get understanding.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Exalt her, and she shall promote thee: she shall bring thee to honor, when thou dost embrace her.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "She shall give to thy head an ornament of grace: a crown of glory shall she deliver to thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hear, O my son, and receive my sayings; and the years of thy life shall be many.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I have taught thee in the way of wisdom; I have led thee in right paths.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When thou goest, thy steps shall not be straitened; and when thou runnest, thou shalt not stumble.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Take fast hold of instruction; let ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "her",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not go: keep her; for she ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thy life.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Enter not into the path of the wicked, and go not in the way of evil ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Avoid it, pass not by it, turn from it, and pass away.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For they sleep not, except they have done mischief; and their sleep is taken away, unless they cause ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "some",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to fall.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For they eat the bread of wickedness, and drink the wine of violence.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the path of the just ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as the shining light, that shineth more and more to the perfect day.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The way of the wicked ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as darkness: they know not at what they stumble.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My son, attend to my words; incline thy ear to my sayings.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let them not depart from thy eyes; keep them in the midst of thy heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For they ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " life to those that find them, and health to all their flesh.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Keep thy heart with all diligence; for out of it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the issues of life.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Put away from thee a froward mouth, and perverse lips put far from thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let thy eyes look right on, and let thy eyelids look straight before thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ponder the path of thy feet, and let all thy ways be established.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.4.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PRO.4.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Turn not to the right hand nor to the left: remove thy foot from evil.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
